{"availability":"available","full":"hilsetapp/Liquid-glass-studio","name":"Liquid-glass-studio","description":"Design the iOS 26 liquid glass effect visually and copy production-ready CSS or Tailwind in one click. Vanilla JS, zero dependencies, no build step.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T17:58:06Z","updated":"2026-10-16T23:47:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hilsetapp.github.io/Liquid-glass-studio/","topics":["css","css-generator","design-tools","frontend","github-pages","glassmorphism","ios26","liquid-glass","tailwindcss","vanilla-javascript"],"demo":"https://hilsetapp.github.io/Liquid-glass-studio/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:59.993Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:59.993Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:59.993Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:13.412Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:49:59.993Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Design Apple's iOS 26 \"liquid glass\" effect visually - copy the CSS in one click.","No sign-up, no build step, no dependencies. Just open and play.","You know those see-through, frosted panels in iOS 26 - where the background shines through, blurred and bent, with a thin light running along the edge? That design language is called Liquid Glass."],"features":["🎛 7 fine-tuned controls - blur, milkiness, saturation, radius, depth, edge light, refraction bend","🧲 Draggable live preview - pull the panel across colorful blobs and watch the light bend","💧 Optional edge refraction via an embedded SVG displacement filter (the wow-detail almost nobody implements)","🎨 6 one-click presets - iOS Dock, Frosted, Thick lens, Dark smoke, Rose glass, Neon edge","🖼 Your own background - upload, drag-and-drop or paste (Ctrl+V) any image, e.g. a screenshot of your site, to tune the glass on your real design"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hilsetapp/Liqui